  "body": "Professionalism  For this course, I define professionalism to mean respect for yourself, your classmates, and your instructor. This includes (but is not limited to)  consistent forward progress and timely completion of assignments,  prompt scheduling of and on-time arrival for individual meetings,  preparation for class, and  attendance and participation in class.    A pattern of unprofessional behavior during the semester may, at my discretion, result in a course grade penalty of up to two full letter grades (20%).  "
